<title>POLAND: PPABank rights first leg 86 pct subscribed.</title>
<headline>PPABank rights first leg 86 pct subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors subscribed for 1,070,729 of Polish Bank Pierwszy Polsko-Amerykanski Bank SA's (PPABank) 1.25-million-rights-issue during the first subscription period, the bank said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The rights were offered from January 13 to February 3.</p>
<p>PPABank said the remaining 179,271 rights would be offered from February 24 to March 10.</p>
<p>The rights are priced at 15.5 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
